Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 13:47:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] B3: bridge the image-search and image-model tool family

Adds the four standard touch points for pdf-tool's ten image-family MCP
tools (search_images, get_image_search_job_status, get_image_search_bank,
update_image_search_candidate, import_image_from_url,
import_images_from_url, get/set_image_search_policy,
get/set_image_model_policy), following delete_pdf_template/health exactly:
wrappers in pdf-tool-client.ts, handlers in mcp-tool-handlers.ts using the
same site-only resolveTemplateBridgeScope as callPdfToolHealth (with
event.log?. structured entries on the mutating tools), tool definitions in
mcp-tool-definitions.ts mirroring pdf-tool's own zod schemas
(netlify/lib/mcp-tool-schemas.ts, cloned read-only from the pdf-tool repo),
dispatch cases in functions/mcp.ts, and a new sibling test file
(tests/netlify/mcp-pdf-tool-image-bridge.test.ts) covering tools/list
exposure, one happy path per tool, an upstream-error passthrough, and
missing-required-arg/foreign-site rejections.

